<title>NETHERLANDS: Rabo Securities ups Heijmans to a Buy.</title>
<headline>Rabo Securities ups Heijmans to a Buy.</headline>
<dateline>AMSTERDAM 1997-02-24</dateline>
<text>
<p>Summary of Feb research.</p>
<p>Company---------Sector--------Price---Broker----------------</p>
<p>Heijmans	  construction  36.00   Rabo Securities</p>
<p>COMMENT: Buy (upgraded from Hold).</p>
<p>After temporary slowdown in earnings growth in 1996, we expect acceleration in 1997 and project 11 percent annual earnings per share growth in years 1997-2000. We consider current valuation relatively attractive and see enough upward potential for outperformance within the sector for the coming twelve months.  </p>
<p>    Estimates (Dfl):   EPS	  P/E     Dividend</p>
<p>    1995 (actual)	2.00	 18.0    0.80</p>
<p>    1996		   2.23	 16.1    0.90</p>
<p>    1997		   2.60	 13.8    1.04</p>
<p>    1998		   2.95	 12.2    1.18</p>
<p>-- Amsterdam newsroom, +31 20 504 5000 (Fax +31 20 504 5040)</p>
